     * fixed {@link #REGION_TIMEZONE} table (NSW-&gt;Australia/Sydney, VIC-&gt;Australia/Melbourne,
     * QLD-&gt;Australia/Brisbane). Returns {@code null} when the region is not one of these, so the
     * field is simply absent.
     */
